Brute Force: Time - O(n^2), Space - O(1)
    - Iterate over the list from both left and right
    - compute the width and heigh for every possible pairs
    - return the maxArea computed for a pair which has the highest yeild
Two Pointers: Time - O(n), Space - O(1)
    - Initialize a left and right pointer at the extreme ends
    - calculate the area of elements at the pointer indexes
    - If the element at left pointer index less than or equals the element at right pointer index
      increment left pointer by 1, else decrement the right pointer by 1 (move inward) until all the elements are traversed.